<title>INDIA: India's RBI lowers cut-off rate at repo to 4.0 pct.</title>
<headline>India's RBI lowers cut-off rate at repo to 4.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it set the cut-off rate at 4.0 percent at Friday's repo auction, down from the previous 4.5 percent.  </p>
<p>The RBI said it received 97 bids for 102.5 billion rupees of which it accepted 25 for 50.96 billion rupees.</p>
<p>The weighted average cut-off worked out to 3.9314, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom  +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
